  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This component, the Colors class, acts as a static registry facade for predefined color constants within the application. It provides type-safe, immediate access to hundreds of named colors (e.g., 'red', 'darkSlateBlue') by returning pre-instantiated Color objects. Its primary architectural role is to centralize color definitions, ensuring consistency across the entire codebase by acting as a canonical lookup table for RGB/RGBA values."
  },
